      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASK ME MATE (1) loves this course and distance with two wins and a placing from just three attempts and has been well in betting in recent outings. Where there's smoke there's fire and should play a major role in the outcome. The well-related PRESSZORA (5) (half to G2 winner Amor Victorious) is a bit hit or miss but will be ready to peak now third run back and should give backers a sight up on speed. LONERGY (2) strips fitter third-up from the spell, draws favourably in gate two and gets some weight off with the 2kg claim. Ticks a few boxes. WARNA (3) also hails from a handy family (half to G2 winner Count De Rupee) and will get a gun run in transit from the inside alley. In the mix. BOLD ARTIC (4) next best.",
